    vcard:note "Software developer by heart, trying to build great software, that serves people. Therefore interested in #softwarequality, #softwarecrafting, #uxthinking and #agile software development.\n\nTo bring back control over our digital lives I care about #openweb, #foss, #datasovereignty #interoperabilty and am actively working on the #solidproject.";
